        "template--18407212810569__60910267-55e8-4e0d-a9f9-79b26b3533dc-16795881913b1fb5f3-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Select your desired sofa and fabric from our website and submit your choice via the <strong>Contact Us</strong> form. We will get back to you via email within 2 days.</p><p>For a quicker response, feel free to reach out to us on Facebook. Our team is available 7 days a week, from 9:00 AM to 5:00 PM Melbourne time (AEDT).</p><p>We are continuously working to include more fabric options in our products. If you have specific fabric preferences that are not currently listed, please don’t hesitate to let us know. <strong>We are always here to help!</strong></p>"
          }
        }
